ng was performed before the clean-cache early return in SceneTreeEditor::_update_node_subtree(), causing every SceneTree refresh to retrieve property lists for all visible nodes. \r\n\r\nFor C# tool scripts this repeatedly crossed the managed boundary\r\nMove resource counting after the clean-cache check and restrict it to the actual SceneTree dock. \r\n\r\nNew, dirty, forced, and removed nodes keep their existing bookkeeping.\r\n\r\nBenchmark on current master, 5000 owned nodes, 3 runs:\r\n- C# removal: 3.401 s -> 0.643 s (-81.1%)\r\n- GDScript removal: 2.632 s -> 0.645 s (-75.5%)\r\n- C# overhead over scriptless: +374.7% -> +3.4%\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-08-13T20:50:59Z","updated_at":"2026-08-13T21:02:29Z","closed_at":"2026-08-13T20:52:09Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"e623f194afd38bc2ec92eacc630b242715b995f7","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"benioriginal:fix-csharp-scenetree-performance-122386","ref":"fix-csharp-scenetree-performance-122386","repo":{"id":1309837044,"node_id":"R_kgDOThKG9A","name":"godot","full_name":"benioriginal/godot","owner":{"login":"benioriginal","id":111044589,"node_id":"U_kgDOBp5n7Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111044589?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benioriginal","html_url":"https://github.com/benioriginal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benioriginal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benioriginal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benioriginal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benioriginal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https:/